WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:06.080
Run Claude, Codex, or any agent in the terminal you already use.

00:06.080 --> 00:11.260
When a supported agent needs permission, the request waits in one inbox.

00:11.410 --> 00:14.550
Away from your desk? Approve it from your phone.

00:14.800 --> 00:17.540
The agent continues in your terminal.

00:17.840 --> 00:21.300
Your agents keep working, wherever you are.
